  "details": "<p><em>The Barrington Atlas Directory</em> notes: Illyrikon. Krete is included on Map 102 of the <em>Barrington Atlas</em>. The compilers note that these places are listed as \"\u00a0Dioceses and Provinces of the Roman Empire according to Hierocles (late 5th\u2013early 6th centuries A.D.)\".</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Krete was a Late Roman province in the Diocese of Macedonia of the Praetorian prefecture of Illyricum.",
